title: "BoliviaAgriculture: Municipal Dataset, Bilingual Dictionary, and Interactive Viewer of the 2013 Bolivia Agricultural Census (339 Municipalities)"
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Leiva
    given-names: Favio
repository-code: "https://github.com/Favioleiva/BoliviaAgriculture"
