license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-22"
abstract: >-
  Municipal dataset, bilingual Spanish/English dictionary, reproducible
  aggregation scripts, and offline interactive viewer for the 2013 Bolivia
  Agricultural Census across 339 municipalities. Underlying INE 2013
  Agricultural Census data and Geo4Bolivia reference boundaries retain their
  respective original licenses and terms.
